        "original_id": "171032a1-16e4-53fc-8bda-670c130eed16",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicholas Hoult, Felicity Jones, Marwan Kenzari, Ben Kingsley, Anthony Hopkins\n- Films: Collide, Undiscovered\n- Awards: Golden Calf for Best Actor\n- Topics: box office records\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Marwan Kenzari won the Golden Calf for Best Actor.\n- The film Collide stars Nicholas Hoult, Felicity Jones, Marwan Kenzari, Ben Kingsley, and Anthony Hopkins.\n- The film Undiscovered held the record for the largest percentage drop in ticket sales from opening weekend to second weekend at 86.4% until Collide broke that record in March 2017.",
